---
const RAW = 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Yourstandby/Yourstandby/main/profile';
---
<section class="panel span-12">
  <div class="panel__head"><span class="panel__tag">CONTRIBUTIONS · LAST 365 DAYS</span></div>
  <picture>
    <source media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" srcset={`${RAW}/contrib-dark.svg`} />
    <img
      src={`${RAW}/contrib-light.svg`}
      alt="过去一年每日提交热力图，地牢配色"
      width="721"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
  </picture>
  <p class="panel__foot">同一份卡片资产由 Actions 每日生成，README 和这里共用。</p>
</section>

<style>
  .panel img { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
</style>
